---
import { TextSection } from '@components/odyssey-theme';
import Layout from '../../layouts/Page.astro';
import { defaultLocale, type Locale } from '../../i18n';
import { useTranslations } from '../../i18n/utils';

interface Props { locale?: Locale; }
const { locale = defaultLocale } = Astro.props;
const t = useTranslations(locale);

const seo = {
  title: t.legal.seoTitle,
  description: t.legal.seoDescription,
};
---

<Layout seo={seo} {locale}>
  <TextSection narrow>
    <h1>Legal &amp; Terms</h1>

    <h2>Terms of Service</h2>

    <p>Welcome to Mountaineer.fi. By accessing this website, you agree to these terms of service. Our platform is dedicated to preserving the legacy of Himalayan exploration through authentic storytelling and historical documentation.</p>

    <p>All content published on Mountaineer.fi is for informational and educational purposes. We strive to maintain accuracy in our historical records but encourage readers to verify details from primary sources when possible.</p>

    <p>User-contributed stories and content must respect the history and traditions of mountaineering. We reserve the right to moderate content that does not align with our values of authenticity, respect, and accuracy.</p>

    <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>

    <p>Remote Valley OS respects your privacy. We collect minimal information necessary to operate this site and improve it. We do not sell or share personal data with third parties.</p>

    <p>Any information you provide through our contact or application forms is used solely for communication purposes and is not shared with external parties without your explicit consent. Form submissions are processed and stored by Netlify on our behalf.</p>

    <h3>Cookies &amp; Analytics</h3>

    <p>We use Google Analytics to understand how visitors use this site so we can improve it. Analytics cookies are <strong>only set after you accept them</strong> via the cookie banner. If you reject them, no analytics cookies are set and no analytics data is collected from your visit.</p>

    <p>When analytics is enabled, we configure it with IP anonymization. You can change or withdraw your choice at any time by clearing this site's data in your browser, which will bring the cookie banner back on your next visit.</p>

    <h3>Open Source</h3>

    <p>Remote Valley OS is an open-source project. Hardware designs, software, and documentation are published under open-source licenses (CERN OHL-S, AGPL-3.0, and CC BY-SA 4.0 respectively). This website's content is available on GitHub.</p>
  </TextSection>
</Layout>